  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2\">      <p xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">    The model reproduces the time profile of the species as depicted in Fig 3A of the paper. Model successfully tested on MathSBML and Jarnac.</p>          </notes>",
